        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí an axweesantá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tidá' aarusmo Yeremia aa axaás daanduú yaamaá Babuloniro nee yaamaá Kaldayo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Asma xoororka /iikú daahh ni haratleér amór xooroorí, yaamuuká' ngiri deewa'atisiyá'. Heé baraaká' i hotaá áw i kaahh, muu nee makaywo tan tlatlaahh baraá yaamuudae.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú Israeli i kaahi, «Qoomaadae nee daqtadae, múk Yuda ta buruumburiit dinkwaárí ale nee tari kii/ ar /aa/e tawa anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín leelehhiiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Loohír gixsár Siyonír kaw kari yaahaas, amooqaqae gur'er'ín nga amoodá' xu'usiyé' tawa kaahi, ‹Qwalaas, ti haragwaa'aán nee AAKOÓ MUNGÚ baraá alqadoodá' alhhe'eesay wasl, tidá' baloó gunqarutaaká.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Muk'eé' a adór bee/ángw aa qwaar, kin qwaareemiis nee de'eemuuser'ín, kina gan'aás gawaá tlom'i, nin gawaá tloomarí wa tláy ay gawaá gongoamooqá', inooín slumtaín ngiri gunqareesiyé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuú gár gaa harasliqiti gina /ák. Wakuuser'ín giri beer, ‹Atén ti tlakweeká asma inooín AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguna sadakuusiyé', kuduú qawtantaín ar ló', AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuduú harahhifór baabi'ii'ín.›",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«/Akumiité' baraá yaamaá Babuloniro, tsee/áy ti'iitaak baraá yaamaá Kaldayo, umuú heewo kuqá' munguwa dán, adór gurtuú geeraá aara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma ga/aaweek aníng xoororka ngi /ur/uúr amór Babuloni, dinku'uumár xoordaá yaariir awa /iikú dahhá', taa amohhe'eesiyé' Babuloni ngiwa hayoohiya'. Maheeri'ín a adór awa migusmoó slaqwarár baál, kudá' dab/oórár waawatlaaká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamaá múk Kaldayo kin hayoh, mukdá' sleémeero gaa hayoh tari hhe'ees. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungásingá' aalir'eé' hayoohimá',",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli, a adór bee/ángw ta slakaati nee diraangw kudá' ta tlatlahhaás. Geeraawo kina hhaamiís nee waawutmoó Ashuru, nee hám daxta Nebukadnesa waawutmoó Babuloni kudá' gaa fadu giqaaqay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmo, Munguú múk Israeli, i kaahi, «Aníng waawutmoó Babuloni un muúx nee yaamuuwose, adoodá' waawutmoó Ashuru ngura muúx. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli u ki/ís baraá qawtanti'ín, nee angamír'ín kari gawaá tloomár Karmeli nee Bashanír wa de'én, muruú /aymár bu'uút nguri slayá' gawaá tlom'aá Efraimu nee Gileadiro.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, «Qoomaadae nee daqtadae tlakweema ki leelehhiit yaamaá múk Israeliwo, ala ki ariiká. Dakuús ka leeleehh yaamaá Yudawo, ala ka harasliqitiiká asma aníng panaydá' aa meet u gurtláw.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i kaahi, «Tlawsé' haratlawé' amór yaamaá Merataimu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Iia qaasaak, inooín naa /akumiitiyé', naa kotsqomitiyé' baraá yaamaá Babulonír wa alé, ta baraá Siyonír wa kángw ilaharmiis adór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúrén li/aay ngura buú', li/aay as Do'ós kudá' hhoohhoó'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Múk ga/ale tlaqutuwo ga xuú' ateetaak as Babuloni kawa i haratlay, umuú heé mahaangw tsaxaararo gu xuú' huwaak. Gixsa harweeraak asma hee miwa /akuút. Li/aay buaak ar qoomoó tlehhmi'iiwós adoodá' múk hatlá' ngway tlehhít ti tlehhe', asma inós ina daara/aán, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, kudá' hhoohhoó' oo Israeli guri waaqá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, masoombar'ín ka tsuu/ baraá afeeni nee slaqwaruuser'ín ka hhaamiis baalaadae. Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ tí ngina oó'».",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ga/aaweek, adoodá' diraangw nir baraá darmuú Yordanír wa /akuuti ay baraá tla/ángw daqtá bee/aangw, an adoodá' aníng múk Babuloni ngur guus baraá yaamuuín wa ale. Aníng geeraharusmooeé' oo ni slaa' un tsawaár, nee nguri qaás. Asma heé adór aníng a heemá? Heé aníng i sakwasleemuút a heemá? De'eemusmoó aníng i tlampa'aás a gaalá? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa qoomeés daanduú múk Babuloniro iiárií qaasaak, nee adoodá' i tleehhamór wa slai dír yaamuloouusér Kaldayo. Tam deeláy'ín awa bee/aangw kun yaamúr duuruxún, nee kiri ar tláy, múk yaamuudá' hoót tari waa/oo/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 50:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kududuhoó hayoohár Babuloni yaamu gi daaraxaas, nee /aa/eeín kiri axaas baraá tla/ángw xoordaá hatlae.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.50.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.50.46"
            ]
          }
